Marked the invalid null/out-of-range case as unlikely so the compiler keeps the common valid return on the fall-through path. This preserves identical behavior while improving hot-path branch layout.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
}
```